{%- comment -%}
  Founding cohort box. There is no seat cap (Oct 2 2026): the founding price is open to everyone until the close
  date, then new members join at the standard price. Close date only, nothing counted. Params: variant (unused)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign f = shop.metafields.strong_years.founding.value
  assign close_date = f.close_date | date: '%B %-d, %Y'
-%}
<div class="cohort" role="status">
  {%- if f.closed -%}
    <p><strong>The founding price has closed.</strong> New members join at the standard price.</p>
  {%- else -%}
    <p><strong>The founding price is open to everyone until {{ close_date }}.</strong> Your price stays the same for as long as you stay subscribed. <a href="/pages/membership-and-cancellation#founding">Full terms</a></p>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
